OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 7, had 'overwhelming'
OL,4,Adiabetes diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a seven-year-old who was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with Type 1 diabetes eight
OL,8,Fweeks ago are urging others to look out
OL,9,Ffor the signs in their children who may
OL,10,Fpresent with the condition.
OL,12,FToday marks World Diabetes Day and
OL,13,Falmost 6,000 people on the island are
OL,14,Frecorded as being on the diabetes
OL,15,Fregister.
OL,17,FJamie and Charlotte Lewis, who had to
OL,18,Fexplain the condition to their son,
OL,19,Fsaid it was better to be aware then be
OL,20,Fsorry.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
