OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 7, had 'overwhelming'
OL,4,Adiabetes diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's quick, it's painful and it's hard
OL,7,Fto get your kids to do it but it is for
OL,8,Ftheir benefit," they said.
